  lines:
  - I stroll through the gates of Oxford , my nerves up in air like rain particles
  - I stroll through the gates of Oxford , my nerves up in air like rain particles
  - 'I bite onto the nail of my thumb

'
  - 'I bite onto the nail of my thumb

'
  - 'FlashBacks of the dream I had replaying through and through

'
  - 'FlashBacks of the dream I had replaying through and through

'
  - "Sigmund Freud was the first to assign meaning to dreams and encourage it\u2019s
    interpretation and how it relates to our subconscious psyche.\r\n"
  - "Sigmund Freud was the first to assign meaning to dreams and encourage it\u2019s
    interpretation and how it relates to our subconscious psyche.\r\n"
  - 'Despite the controversy and critique I may have of Freud, it is an empirical
    fact that his studies paved way for a nuanced perspective around dreams.

'
  - 'Despite the controversy and critique I may have of Freud, it is an empirical
    fact that his studies paved way for a nuanced perspective around dreams.

'
  - 'In his theories of the Interpretation of Dreams in 1899; Freud suggests Dreams
    to represent unconscious desire

'
  - 'In his theories of the Interpretation of Dreams in 1899; Freud suggests Dreams
    to represent unconscious desire

'
  - "But what desire do I have when it comes to violence ? \r\n\r\n"
  - "But what desire do I have when it comes to violence ? \r\n\r\n"
  - 'Against my own father??

'
  - 'Against my own father??

'
  - Is that an honest unconscious desire I have?
  - Is that an honest unconscious desire I have?
  - "\u201CHead in the clouds, Onyx?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CHead in the clouds, Onyx?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CVivienne!\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CVivienne!\u201D\r\n"
