  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 1203059684}
  nameTextComponent: {fileID: 1258884460}
  lines:
  - I go into a stall and lock it, pressing my back to it as my chest heaves up and
    down.
  - I go into a stall and lock it, pressing my back to it as my chest heaves up and
    down.
  - "\u201CF!ck\u201D"
  - "\u201CF!ck\u201D"
  - I curse out as I fish for the newspaper article and hold it in my steady hands,
    I began reading.
  - I curse out as I fish for the newspaper article and hold it in my steady hands,
    I began reading.
  - "Oxford\u2019s worst nightmare: Occultist murders"
  - "Oxford\u2019s worst nightmare: Occultist murders"
  - "\u201CPsychology professor Von Dien was arrested in lecture room 000 on accounts
    of conspiracy of murder , later sentenced to life. Within his office was countless
    pieces of evidence pointing to his practices in the occult, mainly Satanism.\u201D"
  - "\u201CPsychology professor Von Dien was arrested in lecture room 000 on accounts
    of conspiracy of murder , later sentenced to life. Within his office was countless
    pieces of evidence pointing to his practices in the occult, mainly Satanism.\u201D"
  - "\u201CThere were no main witnesses in the execution and splaying of victim-\u201D"
  - "\u201CThere were no main witnesses in the execution and splaying of victim-\u201D"
  - 'S-Spalying?? As in the Blood Eagle ?? Oh god-

'
  - 'S-Spalying?? As in the Blood Eagle ?? Oh god-

'
  - I rush to the open toilet and hunch over , retching in it to the thought. Once
    I'm done I rest on the floor as I continue reading , my nerves on edge and my
    body shaking.
  - I rush to the open toilet and hunch over , retching in it to the thought. Once
    I'm done I rest on the floor as I continue reading , my nerves on edge and my
    body shaking.
  - "\u201CThe only defendant witness being his apprentice, a student in Parapsychology,
    who has chosen to stay anonymous\u201D"
  - "\u201CThe only defendant witness being his apprentice, a student in Parapsychology,
    who has chosen to stay anonymous\u201D"
  - P-Parapsychology, we only just learn it.
  - P-Parapsychology, we only just learn it.
  - "It\u2019s the belief in the perceiving of information about the future and past
    through DREAMS.\r\n"
  - "It\u2019s the belief in the perceiving of information about the future and past
    through DREAMS.\r\n"
  - I'm no longer safe here.
  - I'm no longer safe here.
  - I ran out the gates frantically, catching the last bus home.
  - I ran out the gates frantically, catching the last bus home.
