  textComponent: {fileID: 52462165}
  nameTextComponent: {fileID: 1696244146}
  lines:
  - "\u201CYeah I suppose\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYeah I suppose\u201D\r\n"
  - 'I answer sheepishly fiddling with my hands uncomfortably.

'
  - 'I answer sheepishly fiddling with my hands uncomfortably.

'
  - "\u201CRight? I mean she totally dresses like a hooker just for class, like this
    is Oxford not Hackney\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CRight? I mean she totally dresses like a hooker just for class, like this
    is Oxford not Hackney\u201D\r\n"
  - 'My blood rises and I forcibly keep it at bay.

'
  - 'My blood rises and I forcibly keep it at bay.

'
  - "\u201CRight, right anyways in class I heard you talk about the professor with
    a friend of yours?\u201D\r\n\r\n"
  - "\u201CRight, right anyways in class I heard you talk about the professor with
    a friend of yours?\u201D\r\n\r\n"
  - 'Claire lets out a snobbish laugh as she sips her matcha.

'
  - 'Claire lets out a snobbish laugh as she sips her matcha.

'
  - "\u201CMy my how rude, eavesdropping\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CMy my how rude, eavesdropping\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CIt\u2019s a public space, anyways, what do you know about him?\u201D"
  - "\u201CIt\u2019s a public space, anyways, what do you know about him?\u201D"
  - "\u201CWhy are you so interested\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWhy are you so interested\u201D\r\n"
  - She catches me off guard, I clear my throat.
  - She catches me off guard, I clear my throat.
  - "\u201CCurious besides I can't stand him so looking for more reason to\u201D "
  - "\u201CCurious besides I can't stand him so looking for more reason to\u201D "
  - 'She scans me up and down before looking around and pulling out her phone, not
    before sliding me her phone on the table.

'
  - 'She scans me up and down before looking around and pulling out her phone, not
    before sliding me her phone on the table.

'
  - 'Its a News Article, titled:

'
  - 'Its a News Article, titled:

'
  - "Oxford\u2019s worst nightmare: Occultist murders"
  - "Oxford\u2019s worst nightmare: Occultist murders"
  - 'I freeze in my tracks as I begin reading the text

'
  - 'I freeze in my tracks as I begin reading the text

'
  - "\u201CPsychology professor Von Dien was arrested in lecture room 000 on accounts
    of conspiracy of murder , later sentenced to life. Within his office was countless
    pieces of evidence pointing to his practices in the occult, mainly Satanism.\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CPsychology professor Von Dien was arrested in lecture room 000 on accounts
    of conspiracy of murder , later sentenced to life. Within his office was countless
    pieces of evidence pointing to his practices in the occult, mainly Satanism.\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CThere were no main witnesses in the execution and splaying of victim-\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CThere were no main witnesses in the execution and splaying of victim-\u201D\r\n"
  - I feel sick as I continue reading.
  - I feel sick as I continue reading.
  - "\u201CS-Splaying??\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CS-Splaying??\u201D\r\n"
  - 'Claire nods her head egregiously.

'
  - 'Claire nods her head egregiously.

'
  - "\u201CIt\u2019s exactly what you think, they found her in the middle of a salt
    circle like some sick display\u201D"
  - "\u201CIt\u2019s exactly what you think, they found her in the middle of a salt
    circle like some sick display\u201D"
  - I continue reading despite the horror clouding my mind.
  - I continue reading despite the horror clouding my mind.
  - "\u201CThe only defendant witness being his apprentice, a student in Parapsychology,
    who has chosen to stay anonymous\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CThe only defendant witness being his apprentice, a student in Parapsychology,
    who has chosen to stay anonymous\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CParapsychology?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CParapsychology?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYeah, Draco was majoring in it at the time and followed Von Dien for it
    closely, I  believe it was-\u201D"
  - "\u201CYeah, Draco was majoring in it at the time and followed Von Dien for it
    closely, I  believe it was-\u201D"
  - "\u201CPerceiving information about the future and past through DREAMS\u201D"
  - "\u201CPerceiving information about the future and past through DREAMS\u201D"
  - 'I finished her sentence.

'
  - 'I finished her sentence.

'
  - "\u201COh yeah it was a question in the POP QUIZ earlier\u201D"
  - "\u201COh yeah it was a question in the POP QUIZ earlier\u201D"
  - "\u201CYeah it was a bit of a weird quiz, all on one module\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYeah it was a bit of a weird quiz, all on one module\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CHuh that's odd, mine was on different topics\u201D"
  - "\u201CHuh that's odd, mine was on different topics\u201D"
  - "\u201CWell mine was all about-\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWell mine was all about-\u201D\r\n"
  - 'Dreams.

'
  - 'Dreams.

'
  - 'Dream. Psychology.

'
  - 'Dream. Psychology.

'
  - "\u201CI-I have to go\u201D"
  - "\u201CI-I have to go\u201D"
  - I grab my satchel and storm out of the store, once I was outside I immediately
    hunched over and retched into a nearby trash can.
  - I grab my satchel and storm out of the store, once I was outside I immediately
    hunched over and retched into a nearby trash can.
  - "It can't be. \r\n"
  - "It can't be. \r\n"
