  - 'Walking along the corridor, taking note of all the family pictures, back to
    a simpler time where I was happier and had less questions.   '
  - "Walking along the corridor, taking note of all the family pictures, back to
    a simpler time where I was happier and had less questions. \r\n\r\n"
  - "\u201CWhere are you Scribbles\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWhere are you Scribbles\u201D\r\n"
  - 'Oh how I was dreading our next encounter. '
  - 'Oh how I was dreading our next encounter. '
  - 'I hear footsteps behind me and immediately turn around , catching myself on
    my feet from the sight.

'
  - 'I hear footsteps behind me and immediately turn around , catching myself on
    my feet from the sight.

'
  - "\u201CNyx\u2026\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CNyx\u2026\u201D\r\n"
  - My father wheezes out, the sight of him is terrifying.
  - My father wheezes out, the sight of him is terrifying.
  - 'He has the head of a vulture and the dying body of an old man, he hunches as
    he walks and wheezes as he speaks, his hand affixed to his nape.

'
  - 'He has the head of a vulture and the dying body of an old man, he hunches as
    he walks and wheezes as he speaks, his hand affixed to his nape.

'
  - "\u201CD-Dad?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CD-Dad?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYou never,,,*wheeze* came to check in on your old man\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYou never,,,*wheeze* came to check in on your old man\u201D\r\n"
  - My eyes widen and a strike of guilt pangs in my chest.
  - My eyes widen and a strike of guilt pangs in my chest.
  - "\u201CI had asked Ma to check in on me-\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CI had asked Ma to check in on me-\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COh how convenient, right, instead of borrowing me your sight you borrow
    me second hand concern\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COh how convenient, right, instead of borrowing me your sight you borrow
    me second hand concern\u201D\r\n"
  - "\r\nHe spits out, I grit my teeth and turn my back on him \r\n"
  - "\r\nHe spits out, I grit my teeth and turn my back on him \r\n"
  - 'Only to come face to face with him once again.

'
  - 'Only to come face to face with him once again.

'
  - "\u201CI don't have time for this\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CI don't have time for this\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CMake some\u201D"
  - "\u201CMake some\u201D"
  - "\u201CWhat if I were bleeding out in the sheets of that bed, would you have
    cried or turned on the washing machine\u201D"
  - "\u201CWhat if I were bleeding out in the sheets of that bed, would you have
    cried or turned on the washing machine\u201D"
  - "\u201CI would hope your final act of love is scrubbing out my stains by hand\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CI would hope your final act of love is scrubbing out my stains by hand\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWhat are you on about\u201D"
  - "\u201CWhat are you on about\u201D"
  - "\u201CI know you truly hate me Nyx, and I'm fine by that\u201D"
  - "\u201CI know you truly hate me Nyx, and I'm fine by that\u201D"
  - "\u201CI never asked for your love but for your respect and you\u2019ve given
    that to me unlike your mother at times but even she learns her lesson for that\u201D"
  - "\u201CI never asked for your love but for your respect and you\u2019ve given
    that to me unlike your mother at times but even she learns her lesson for that\u201D"
  - I grit my teeth with balled up fists. He was beginning to agitate me.
  - I grit my teeth with balled up fists. He was beginning to agitate me.
  - "\u201CI have no words for you\u201D"
  - "\u201CI have no words for you\u201D"
  - "\u201CHow brave of you to lie to yourself, take a look around , in this HellScape
    you\u2019ve created\u201D"
  - "\u201CHow brave of you to lie to yourself, take a look around , in this HellScape
    you\u2019ve created\u201D"
  - "\u201COnly my daughter could be capable of creating something this dark\u201D"
  - "\u201COnly my daughter could be capable of creating something this dark\u201D"
  - I snap
  - I snap
  - "\u201CI did not create anything and I am nothing like you\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CI did not create anything and I am nothing like you\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CExcept you are everything like me Nyx and more\u201D"
  - "\u201CExcept you are everything like me Nyx and more\u201D"
  - 'He taunts me and I try not to cave in

'
  - 'He taunts me and I try not to cave in

'
  - "\u201CYou constantly fight against what you succumb to , hiding behind this
    tired and performative callousness towards me, you are only proving me more right.
    \u201D"
  - "\u201CYou constantly fight against what you succumb to , hiding behind this
    tired and performative callousness towards me, you are only proving me more right.
    \u201D"
  - "\u201CYou\u2019re a scavenger, a gambler and abusive, you count days till down
    till you\u2019ll pass away on the couch you rot on\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYou\u2019re a scavenger, a gambler and abusive, you count days till down
    till you\u2019ll pass away on the couch you rot on\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CAnd you my love? How are you different\u201D"
  - "\u201CAnd you my love? How are you different\u201D"
  - "\u201CYou sponge off your university, roll the dice on just how much of your
    sanity you can deal without and treat others as disposable to your cause if need
    be\u201D"
  - "\u201CYou sponge off your university, roll the dice on just how much of your
    sanity you can deal without and treat others as disposable to your cause if need
    be\u201D"
  - 'I snap

'
  - 'I snap

'
  - "\u201CYOU KNOW NOTHING\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYOU KNOW NOTHING\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CI'M YOU FOR GOD'S SAKE NYX\u201D"
  - "\u201CI'M YOU FOR GOD'S SAKE NYX\u201D"
  - "\u201CWhat??\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWhat??\u201D\r\n"
  - 'His visage immediately disappears and he transforms into a mirror, my reflection
    glaring back at me. '
  - 'His visage immediately disappears and he transforms into a mirror, my reflection
    glaring back at me. '
  - "\u201CYou have my eyes\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYou have my eyes\u201D\r\n"
  - "It can\u2019t be.\r\n"
  - 
