  nameTextComponent: {fileID: 1136447295}
  lines:
  - 'Despite the anxiety rushing through my veins to even my tear burnt cheeks '
  - 'Despite the anxiety rushing through my veins to even my tear burnt cheeks '
  - 'I swallow it all down in favour of not missing school

'
  - 'I swallow it all down in favour of not missing school

'
  - 'To take a break would mean to lose

'
  - 'To take a break would mean to lose

'
  - "It\u2019s my final year, "
  - "It\u2019s my final year, "
  - 'The Final Stretch

'
  - 'The Final Stretch

'
  - 'If I lose my sense of routine by Day 2  '
  - 'If I lose my sense of routine by Day 2  '
  - 'I will lose my direction by Day 3.

'
  - 'I will lose my direction by Day 3.

'
  - "There are no such thing as \u201CMental Health days\u201D\r\n\r\n"
  - "There are no such thing as \u201CMental Health days\u201D\r\n\r\n"
  - 'In , ironically, the Psychology department.

'
  - 'In , ironically, the Psychology department.

'
  - 'KNOCK KNOCK KNOCK '
  - 'KNOCK KNOCK KNOCK '
  - 'My door creaks open , a familiar smile peaking through

'
  - 'My door creaks open , a familiar smile peaking through

'
  - "\u201DGood morning my dear, eager for your Second day, final year\u201D \r\n"
  - "\u201DGood morning my dear, eager for your Second day, final year\u201D \r\n"
  - "\u201DGood morning Ma\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201DGood morning Ma\u201D\r\n"
  - 'I blink twice as I soak in her features, her Human features

'
  - 'I blink twice as I soak in her features, her Human features

'
  - I appreciate her horizontal eyes and lack of snout accompanied by wool and eerie
    messages
  - I appreciate her horizontal eyes and lack of snout accompanied by wool and eerie
    messages
  - "I rise to my feet, relieved to see her \r\n"
  - "I rise to my feet, relieved to see her \r\n"
