  lines:
  - "\u201CClaire, how about some coffee?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CClaire, how about some coffee?\u201D\r\n"
  - 'I ask and she gleams up looking at Jasper boastingly.

'
  - 'I ask and she gleams up looking at Jasper boastingly.

'
  - "\u201CLooks like I'm the favourite Twin\u201D\r\n"
