  lines:
  - ' Blood.  '
  - ' Blood.  '
  - 'His blood.

'
  - 'His blood.

'
  - "I gasp and see an open wound , a slit on his forearm , pouring out slowly as
    if my touch triggered it. Draco\u2019s breath hitches soft enough for me to hear
    it as he immediately retracts his arm away from view. \r\n\r\n"
  - "I gasp and see an open wound , a slit on his forearm , pouring out slowly as
    if my touch triggered it. Draco\u2019s breath hitches soft enough for me to hear
    it as he immediately retracts his arm away from view. \r\n\r\n"
  - "\u201CMy apologies Nyx, slip of the blade during dinner preparations last night\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CMy apologies Nyx, slip of the blade during dinner preparations last night\u201D\r\n"
  - "He addresses me \r\n"
  - "He addresses me \r\n"
  - "\u201CT-theres no register for this class\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CT-theres no register for this class\u201D\r\n"
  - 'I say and we share a look that lasts about 3 seconds before he clinically walks
    away. '
  - 'I say and we share a look that lasts about 3 seconds before he clinically walks
