  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad5815a14f6884d4bac95b73796cbc8c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 147912290}
  nameTextComponent: {fileID: 1054419593}
  lines:
  - We begin making our way to the 10AM with Professor Draco.
  - We begin making our way to the 10AM with Professor Draco.
  - 'Finding seats in the front , We notice him nowhere to be seen.

'
  - 'Finding seats in the front , We notice him nowhere to be seen.

'
  - "\u201CHe\u2019s most likely running late\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CHe\u2019s most likely running late\u201D\r\n"
  - 'Vivienne says , re-applying her lipstick and smiling ear to ear , fishing out
    my books I hear murmurs fill the room.

'
  - 'Vivienne says , re-applying her lipstick and smiling ear to ear , fishing out
    my books I hear murmurs fill the room.

'
  - "\u201CSeems it\u2019s the same as Last Year isnt it\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CSeems it\u2019s the same as Last Year isnt it\u201D\r\n"
  - 'An unfamiliar voice complains, i sit silently to eavesdrop, pretending to fish
    my books out longer than it usually takes to buy time

'
  - 'An unfamiliar voice complains, i sit silently to eavesdrop, pretending to fish
    my books out longer than it usually takes to buy time

'
  - "\u201CMaybe but would he really risk another Disclipinary hearing?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CMaybe but would he really risk another Disclipinary hearing?\u201D\r\n"
  - 'Disciplinary hearing ? Professor Draco?

'
  - 'Disciplinary hearing ? Professor Draco?

'
  - "\u201CWho knows , which student would be worth the risk of losing your job?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWho knows , which student would be worth the risk of losing your job?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CHopefully me, God, he\u2019s hot , like that teacher from Miller\u2019s
    girl.\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CHopefully me, God, he\u2019s hot , like that teacher from Miller\u2019s
    girl.\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYeah right Claire , make it real obvious your dad didnt hold you as a
    kid\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYeah right Claire , make it real obvious your dad didnt hold you as a
    kid\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYeah right Claire , make it real obvious your dad didnt hold you as a
    kid\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COh shut up , like you wouldn't\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COh shut up , like you wouldn't\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CI wouldnt actually given the rumours about him?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CI wouldnt actually given the rumours about him?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COnyx did you do the readings for this lecture? I did if you want a debrief\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COnyx did you do the readings for this lecture? I did if you want a debrief\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CRumours?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CRumours?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYes\u201D"
  - "\u201CYes\u201D"
  - "\u201CFirslty he leaves campus late like right before midnight everyday, on
    some occasions he\u2019s spotted smoking by the gates around the AM times by
    those living on res\u2026\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CFirslty he leaves campus late like right before midnight everyday, on
    some occasions he\u2019s spotted smoking by the gates around the AM times by
    those living on res\u2026\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CHe also secludes himself to his office which is technically a huge study,
    he\u2019s been around Oxford long enough for them to upgrade his space\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CHe also secludes himself to his office which is technically a huge study,
    he\u2019s been around Oxford long enough for them to upgrade his space\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWait wait - did he study here?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWait wait - did he study here?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CStudy here?? Claire he was practically apprentice to Mr. Van Dien\u201D"
  - "\u201CStudy here?? Claire he was practically apprentice to Mr. Van Dien\u201D"
  - "\u201CMr. Van Dien? Isn't that the devil worshipper professor\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CMr. Van Dien? Isn't that the devil worshipper professor\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CI believe so , he was arrested on conspiracy of occult. Draco was around
    our age when they took him away , they even used to call Draco - Shadow , since
    he was always in Van Dien\u2019s shadow.\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CI believe so , he was arrested on conspiracy of occult. Draco was around
    our age when they took him away , they even used to call Draco - Shadow , since
    he was always in Van Dien\u2019s shadow.\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COnyx??\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COnyx??\u201D\r\n"
  - My daydreaming is interrupted by Vivienne with a concerned look.
  - My daydreaming is interrupted by Vivienne with a concerned look.
  - "\u201CWhat\u2019s wrong it seems you\u2019ve seen a ghost-\u201D"
  - "\u201CWhat\u2019s wrong it seems you\u2019ve seen a ghost-\u201D"
  - "\u201CWh-what do you know about Professor Draco?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWh-what do you know about Professor Draco?\u201D\r\n"
  - "Vivienne chuckles and raises an eyebrow \r\n"
  - "Vivienne chuckles and raises an eyebrow \r\n"
  - "\u201CWell that he\u2019s our psychology professor and not big on punctuality\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWell that he\u2019s our psychology professor and not big on punctuality\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CNo like, with him and Van Dien\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CNo like, with him and Van Dien\u201D\r\n"
  - "Vivi\u2019s eyes widen and she bites her cheek then scoffs looking down \r\n"
  - "Vivi\u2019s eyes widen and she bites her cheek then scoffs looking down \r\n"
  - "\u201CIts all Bull, dont involve yourself with the rumors Onyx\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CIts all Bull, dont involve yourself with the rumors Onyx\u201D\r\n"
  - "I raise an eyebrow, Vivi became defensive all of a sudden but before I could
    protest the man of the hour rushes in. \r\n"
  - "I raise an eyebrow, Vivi became defensive all of a sudden but before I could
    protest the man of the hour rushes in. \r\n"
