  nameTextComponent: {fileID: 1328624939}
  lines:
  - "\u201CI suggest you watch it Claire, I know gossiping is your bit but I only
    just met you and you\u2019re already taking jabs at my friend\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CI suggest you watch it Claire, I know gossiping is your bit but I only
    just met you and you\u2019re already taking jabs at my friend\u201D\r\n"
  - ' Claire wears a shocked expression, she looks to me agitated before gathering
    her things to head out.'
  - ' Claire wears a shocked expression, she looks to me agitated before gathering
    her things to head out.'
  - "\u201CNow I can see why, you both have so much in common\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CNow I can see why, you both have so much in common\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CAs do you and a jellyfish, spineless\u201D "
  - "\u201CAs do you and a jellyfish, spineless\u201D\r\n"
  - 'She scoffs angrily before hastily rushing off.

'
  - 'She scoffs angrily before hastily rushing off.

'
  - 'I roll my eyes and grit my teeth.

'
  - 'I roll my eyes and grit my teeth.

'
  - 'It would have been crucial to learn more about the professor, just to put my
    mind at ease.

'
  - 'It would have been crucial to learn more about the professor, just to put my
    mind at ease.

'
  - "But in the face of my morale, I couldn\u2019t sacrifice."
  - "But in the face of my morale, I couldn\u2019t sacrifice."
  - "I check my watch, it\u2019s about time I go home. "
  - "I check my watch, it\u2019s about time I go home.\r\n"
