  textComponent: {fileID: 55606073}
  nameTextComponent: {fileID: 861001862}
  lines:
  - The stars were out and so was the moon, when I was younger I used to imagine
    the stars to be people stuck in the sky during their ascension to heaven.
  - The stars were out and so was the moon, when I was younger I used to imagine
    the stars to be people stuck in the sky during their ascension to heaven.
  - I'd imagine these people to be of morally grey heart, not good enough to pass
    the gates but not bad enough to sink as low.
  - I'd imagine these people to be of morally grey heart, not good enough to pass
    the gates but not bad enough to sink as low.
  - 'The moon would be their beacon of hope , something they yearn to touch but could
    never quite reach.

'
  - 'The moon would be their beacon of hope , something they yearn to touch but could
    never quite reach.

'
  - "Sleep Paralysis terrifies me , the notion of your body weighing down like a
    cage \r\nYour limbs barely in function while your mind torments you\r\n"
  - "Sleep Paralysis terrifies me , the notion of your body weighing down like a
    cage \r\nYour limbs barely in function while your mind torments you\r\n"
  - "Sounds like it\u2019s own personal hell \r\n"
  - "Sounds like it\u2019s own personal hell \r\n"
