  lines:
  - "\u201CIt\u2019s a pleasure meeting you, I feel like I need to make new friends
    in class\u201D "
  - "\u201CIt\u2019s a pleasure meeting you, I feel like I need to make new friends
    in class\u201D\r\n"
  - 'I sip at my coffee and smile politely.

'
  - 'I sip at my coffee and smile politely.

'
  - "\u201CYeah I guess I'm the same, I only ever talk to Vivi\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYeah I guess I'm the same, I only ever talk to Vivi\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CVivi? Oh, is that the girl you hang around all the time with the red lipstick?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CVivi? Oh, is that the girl you hang around all the time with the red lipstick?\u201D\r\n"
  - 'I nod , it is much like Vivi to draw attention.

'
  - 'I nod , it is much like Vivi to draw attention.

'
  - "\u201CYeah. we\u2019ve known each other for some time\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CYeah. we\u2019ve known each other for some time\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COh. that\u2019s strange, I wouldn\u2019t expect you to be friends with
    someone like her\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COh. that\u2019s strange, I wouldn\u2019t expect you to be friends with
    someone like her\u201D\r\n"
  - 'I raise an eyebrow

'
  - 'I raise an eyebrow

'
  - "\u201CSomeone like her?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CSomeone like her?\u201D\r\n"
  - 'Claire catches my slight anger and begins getting nervous.

'
  - 'Claire catches my slight anger and begins getting nervous.

'
  - "\u201COh- all I mean is I've heard alot about her, she\u2019s got quite the
    reputation\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COh- all I mean is I've heard alot about her, she\u2019s got quite the
    reputation\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CReputation?\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CReputation?\u201D\r\n"
  - 'If I correct Claire and defend Vivi, she might not be as eager to give me the
    info I may need '
  - 'If I correct Claire and defend Vivi, she might not be as eager to give me the
    info I may need '
  - "whereas I\u2019ve known Vivienne for years and what kind of friend would I be
    not defending her?\r\n"
  - "whereas I\u2019ve known Vivienne for years and what kind of friend would I be
